@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.38.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.38.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.37.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.38.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 16 spec story started. Discipline files read again from GitHub before the step (OE_Operating_Discipline_v2_41_0, LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE_v163_0_7). The chapter 16 deck is still built by its own builder (deck 2.0.1, with analogy slides); this story moves its examples, visuals and words into a spec of the generic builder, unchanged in content, so each example result can be compared with the old build."""@en .

ex:ST10_Spec_16 backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress .
ex:TK10_Spec_16_Build backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Started 2026-11-25. Port from 08-tooling/ch16-deck (examples_v2_0_0, deck_visuals_v2_0_0, deck_content_v2_0_1 and the plan, parts and slide words that the old builder holds inline). The content stays as it is in this story, so the comparison with the old build is exact; the rulings of 2026-11-14 and 2026-11-24 (plain code, no analogies, notes for the reader) belong to the deck story that follows." .
